# KairoX86#319: the IBM PCjr's video on the GPU: its text as cells, its 2-, 4- and 16-colour graphics as 1, 2 or 4 bits
# a pixel (the 640 x 200 x 4 mode two planes) through the gate array's palette, pcjr_render_gpu reading them as
